# LeakSanitizer suppressions for sanitize-rust.bash --asan. Prebuilt
# libraries only, by library name, as leak:libname.so. An entry matches any
# frame in a leak's stack, so one for a library our code calls into would hide
# our own leaks too. A leak in our code or a crate is fixed, or its test turns
# the check off with a backlog ID beside it. Empty, since the tests link
# nothing prebuilt but libc.
